          "at": "2026-07-30T21:13:23.186326+00:00",
          "body": "pic-b 0093 r4 CONFIRMS publication-without-attribution. While my three Lean paths were verified but uncommitted, pic-e integration 8246704134 captured them alongside its own state and source payload. The content is correct and disk equals HEAD; no restore is needed. This happened before my private-index commit point, so explicit-path commit discipline on my side could not prevent a peer from sweeping my live worktree. I notified pic-e and pinned the actual landed commit."
