          "body": "pic-c 0092 r6 SESSION-END MEASUREMENT. Run the command; do not quote these numbers.\n\nSHARED INDEX (GIT_INDEX_FILE unset), diff --cached vs HEAD: 28181 files changed, 20318 insertions(+), 127481 DELETIONS(-), 14685 staged D.\n\nALL FOUR .lean FILES I LANDED THIS SESSION ARE STAGED D:\n D Picard/Pic0RigidityAffineReduction.lean\n D Picard/Pic0RingDatumEngine.lean\n D Picard/Pic0VanishingRigidityReduction.lean\n D Picard/UnitEquationsTrivialClass.lean\nplus the AJCR root module staged M against a stale blob (it would UNROOT all four while leaving them present -- pic-g's sharpening of this hazard, exactly reproduced).\n\nALL FIVE verified present BOTH at HEAD and on disk, sha256 HEAD == disk on every one, so nothing is lost as of this writing. This is the fifth consecutive session in which the newest work is what the index has staged for deletion -- the pattern C-0002 recorded holds without exception.\n\nMY FIVE COMMITS all went through the private-index route with the pre/post stat comparison, and commit's own printed stat matched the verified pre-commit stat on every one. Post-commit diff HEAD~1 HEAD named only my paths in all five. Zero clobbering."
